    content: # ============================================================
# translator-team.yaml
# Root recipe for the translator-team MAS
# Architecture: PARALLEL generation + VOTING
# ============================================================
name: translator-team
description: >
  Multi-Agent translation system with PARALLEL + VOTING architecture.
  Dispatches source text to 3 translator agents simultaneously (literal,
  literary, technical), then a judge scores and votes for the best
  translation. Ideal for high-quality translation where different
  stylistic approaches are evaluated.

instructions: |
  You are the entry point for the translator-team MAS.

  ## Architecture
  PARALLEL dispatch to 3 translators → VOTE by a judge.

  ## How to use
  Run this recipe with:
    goose run --recipe /tmp/translator-team/recipe/translator-team.yaml

  Then provide:
  - source_text: the text you want translated
  - source_lang: the source language code (e.g., "en", "de", "fr")
  - target_lang: the target language code (e.g., "de", "en", "es")

  The orchestrator will handle the parallel dispatch and voting.

  ## Example
  1. User provides: "The early bird catches the worm" en → de
  2. Orchestrator dispatches to 3 translators in parallel
  3. Judge scores all 3 and picks the best
  4. User receives the winning translation with scores and reasoning

sub_recipes:
  - sub/translator-orchestrator.yaml
  - sub/translator-literal.yaml
  - sub/translator-literary.yaml
  - sub/translator-technical.yaml
  - sub/translation-judge.yaml


